<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Unlock Your Private Data</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb;
            --primary-dark: #1d4ed8;
            --success: #16a34a;
            --bg: #f5f7fb;
            --card: #ffffff;
            --text: #1f2937;
            --muted: #6b7280;
            --border: #e5e7eb;
            --radius: 14px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Inter, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, .08);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6);
            color: white;
            padding: 35px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header p {
            opacity: .95;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 35px;
        }

        .notice {
            background: #eff6ff;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            padding: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .notice strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .features {
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .features h2 {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .features ul {
            margin-left: 22px;
        }

        .features li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .warning {
            background: #fefce8;
            border: 1px solid #fde68a;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .warning h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        input[type=password] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        input[type=password]:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, .15);
        }

        .small {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 35px;
        }

        button {
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 22px;
            font-size: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: .2s;
        }

        .primary {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
        }

        .primary:hover {
            background: var(--primary-dark);
        }

        .secondary {
            background: #f3f4f6;
        }

        .secondary:hover {
            background: #e5e7eb;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .alert {
            padding: 16px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-left: 5px solid;
        }

        .alert strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .alert p {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .alert-error {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border-color: #dc2626;
            color: #991b1b;
        }

        .alert-success {
            background: #ecfdf5;
            border-color: #16a34a;
            color: #166534;
        }

        .alert-warning {
            background: #fffbeb;
            border-color: #d97706;
            color: #92400e;
        }

        .alert-info {
            background: #eff6ff;
            border-color: #2563eb;
            color: #1d4ed8;
        }
    </style>

</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="card">

            <div class="header">
                <h1>🔒 Unlock Your Private Data</h1>
                <p>Your account supports end-to-end encrypted content.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="content">

                <div class="notice">
                    <strong>Your privacy comes first</strong>

                    Your personal encryption key is used to encrypt and decrypt your private content.
                    The key is never stored on our servers or in the database. It exists only during
                    your current login session.
                </div>

                <div class="features">

                    <h2>How it works</h2>

                    <ul>
                        <li>Your password signs you into your account.</li>
                        <li>Your encryption key unlocks your private content.</li>
                        <li>Every protected item you create is encrypted before being saved.</li>
                        <li>Only someone with your encryption key can read your encrypted content.</li>
                        <li>Even administrators and database administrators cannot decrypt your data.</li>
                    </ul>

                </div>

                <div class="warning">

                    <h3>Important</h3>

                    <p>
                        Choose a memorable encryption key. Since it is never stored by the server,
                        we cannot recover it if you forget it.
                    </p>

                    <br>

                    <p>
                        If you enter a different key than the one used previously, your encrypted
                        content will appear unreadable because it cannot be decrypted.
                    </p>

                </div>

                {% if error %}
                <!-- Validation Error -->
                <div class="alert alert-error">
                    <strong>Unable to unlock your data</strong>
                    <p>
                        {{ error }}
                    </p>
                </div>
                {% endif %}

                <form method="post">

                    <div class="form-group">

                        <label for="key">
                            Encryption Key
                        </label>

                        <input id="key" name="encryption_key" type="password" autocomplete="off"
                            placeholder="Enter your personal encryption key">

                        <div class="small">
                            This key is stored only in your current session and is removed when you log out.
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="actions">

                        <button class="primary" type="submit">
                            Unlock My Private Data
                        </button>

                        <button class="secondary" type="submit" name="skip_encryption" value="1">
                            Continue Without Encryption
                        </button>

                    </div>

                </form>

                <div class="footer">

                    You can continue without an encryption key, but any features that require
                    private encrypted storage will be unavailable until you unlock your data.

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>

</html>